runningmateQuestions = JSON.parse("[{\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 903, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While your nomination was met with tepid applause, when it came to your running mate that's where things got more heated. Many potential candidates outright refused, some simply didn't want to stain their reputation, or were unavaliable. When you finally selected your running mate, the convention had to go for a voice call for the first time in it's history.<br>While Steve Symms was able to get through relatively unopposed, many are still unsure of him. How would you like to introduce him?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 904, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While your nomination was met with tepid applause, when it came to your running mate that's where things got more heated. Many potential candidates outright refused, some simply didn't want to stain their reputation, or were unavaliable. When you finally selected your running mate, the convention had to go for a voice call for the first time in it's history.<br>Fortunately Dan Quayle was able to get through unopposed, yet many are still unsure of him. How would you like to introduce him?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 905, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While your nomination was met with tepid applause, when it came to your running mate that's where things got more heated. Many potential candidates outright refused, some simply didn't want to stain their reputation, or were unavaliable. When you finally selected your running mate, the convention had to go for a voice call for the first time in it's history.<br>While Jack Kemp was able to get through unopposed, some question your selection. How would you like to introduce him?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 906, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While your nomination was met with tepid applause, when it came to your running mate that's where things got more heated. Many potential candidates outright refused, some simply didn't want to stain their reputation, or were unavaliable. When you finally selected your running mate, the convention had to go for a voice call for the first time in it's history.<br>While Paul Laxalt was able to get through unopposed, some question your selection. How would you like to introduce him?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 907, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While your nomination was met with tepid applause, when it came to your running mate that's where things got more heated. Many potential candidates outright refused, some simply didn't want to stain their reputation, or were unavaliable. When you finally selected your running mate, the convention had to go for a voice call for the first time in it's history.<br>As the convention goes on, many are eagerly awaiting your running mate. Yet time passes on before Nuttle whispers to you.<br>“We've tried to get in contact with Governor Deukmejian. It's so for been unsuccessful. The operators told us he isn't accepting messages at this time. We aren't getting him Robertson. We need to get a replacement quick.”\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 925, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As you and Symms have gotten to know each other, campaigning has been much more easier. Though now that you think about it there's more that he could be of use for. You just need to think how to use him.<br>How would you like to utilize your running mate?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 926, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As you and Quayle have gotten to know each other, campaigning has been much more easier. Though now that you think about it there's more that he could be of use for. You just need to think how to use him.<br>How would you like to utilize your running mate?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 927, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As you and Kemp have gotten to know each other, campaigning has been much more easier. Though now that you think about it there's more that he could be of use for. You just need to think how to use him.<br>How would you like to utilize your running mate?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 928, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As you and Laxalt have gotten to know each other, campaigning has been much more easier. Though now that you think about it there's more that he could be of use for. You just need to think how to use him.<br>How would you like to utilize your running mate?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 929, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As you and Dornan have gotten to know each other, campaigning has been much more easier. Though now that you think about it there's more that he could be of use for. You just need to think how to use him.<br>How would you like to utilize your running mate?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 930, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While at a typical campaign rally, Marc Nuttle interupts one of your usual speeches and brings you to a more secluded spot. Telling you that your running mate has gotten into some hot water that the press are covering.<br>Symms' various votes in the Senate have been dug into and blasted, indicating how much of a strident conservative he his. The Democratic campaign have been making hay of it, and you'll need to dispel it.<br>How will you address your running mate's problems?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 931, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While at a typical campaign rally, Marc Nuttle interupts one of your usual speeches and brings you to a more secluded spot. Telling you that your running mate has gotten into some hot water that the press are covering.<br>Quayle and his lack of experience has been blasted from the rooftops. Questioning how ready he would be if his finger were on the red button alongside his knack for making misstatements.<br>How will you address your running mate's problems?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 932, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While at a typical campaign rally, Marc Nuttle interupts one of your usual speeches and brings you to a more secluded spot. Telling you that your running mate has gotten into some hot water that the press are covering.<br>There have been, as of currently, unsubstantiated rumors that Kemp is a homosexual. While he has insistently denied the claims everytime they're brought up, perhaps you can do something to quell them.<br>How will you address your running mate's problems?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 933, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While at a typical campaign rally, Marc Nuttle interupts one of your usual speeches and brings you to a more secluded spot. Telling you that your running mate has gotten into some hot water that the press are covering.<br>Similar to you, Laxalt recently went to court against a newspaper for libel. Alleging his connection to a casino he was associated with skimming money from people. While the lawsuit was dropped, it's still persisting.<br>How will you address your running mate's problems?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 934, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"While at a typical campaign rally, Marc Nuttle interupts one of your usual speeches and brings you to a more secluded spot. Telling you that your running mate has gotten into some hot water that the press are covering.<br>The press have uncovered the domestic abuse that occurs in the Dornan household, with Robert allegedly being violent with his wife Sallie. This has made your previous history get brought back up in the national conversation.<br>How will you address your running mate's problems?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}]");

moderaterepublicansQuestions = JSON.parse("[{\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 940, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As October nearly comes to a close, Marc Nuttle rushes to you with urgent news.<br>“I got some great news Mr. Robertson. It seems that the president has finally gave in and is willing to support our campaign. This is big, and we're going to need to take advantage of this while the water is hot.”<br>How would you like to utilize Ronald Reagan?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 941, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As October nearly comes to a close, Marc Nuttle rushes to you with urgent news.<br>“Mr. Robertson! You're not going to believe this. The Vice-President has seen our campaign as one with a chance to get in for a third term. He's said that he's available, this is the next best thing we can get to the president himself.”<br>How would you like to utilize George Bush?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 942, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As October nearly comes to a close, Marc Nuttle rushes to you with urgent news.<br>“Remember all those national Republicans that didn't want to be seen with you? Some are willing to step out of their space and willing to work with our campaign. Finally! It's not the big names, but we have to take what we can get.”<br>How would you like to utilize these Republicans?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 944, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As October nearly comes to a close, Marc Nuttle rushes to you with urgent news.<br>“Mr. Robertson. A few Republicans have formally endorsed our Democratic opponent. Now, while that's bad, they're more low profile. State legislators, state senators, local officials, maybe a handful from Congress. It'll still sting us though, they're already airing spots about this.”<br>What can we do?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 945, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As October nearly comes to a close, Marc Nuttle rushes to you with urgent news.<br>“Robertson. I've gotten word of a few Republicans endorsing our Democratic opponent. No, no. We're not talking small-scale. Think a handful from Congress, a couple of these moderate backbenchers, you've probably already seen Weicker's endorsement haven't you? Though, that was always out of the question wasn't it? Yeah, yeah, but they're airing spots.”<br>What can we do?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 946, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As October nearly comes to a close, Marc Nuttle rushes to you with urgent news.<br>“Robertson. I think you're going to want to calm down after I'm done with what I'm saying. John Heinz, David Durenberger, Jim Jeffords. They're endorsing our opponent. They've already aired out spots with these endorsements. Here, I'll show you it in a bit. We're underwater aren't we?”<br>What can we do?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}]");

octobersurpriseQuestions = JSON.parse("[{\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 947, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"The press, as skeezy and untrustworthy as they are, have seemingly gotten 'the scoop' that everyone's talking about. Fellow televangelists, Jim and Tammy Bakker have just been implicated in a coverup from Jim taking advantage of a secretary at his PTL ministry. This has also uncovered the more unscrupulous tactics they partook such as skimming money off the top.<br>In addition to giving the televangelism industry a bad name, you've previously worked with them and tabloids are already pointing towards you in all of this. Why didn't you know?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 948, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"The press, as skeezy and untrustworthy as they are, have seemingly gotten 'the scoop' that everyone's talking about. A fellow televangelist and key campaign surrogate Jimmy Swaggart has just been exposed for meeting and partaking in with a prostitute. This affair has been sweet gold to tabloid rags, and your close association to him is bringing up big questions.<br>Swaggart, for his part, has given a 'heartfelt' confession for his sin.\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 949, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"As the polls show your opponent leagues above you, it fills you with an anger. Something that you've always kept inside. It's getting tiring isn't it? The false reporters, the sleazy papers, everyone's out to get you. You need to end these false claims against you from the liberal media. Show them your serious.<br>You accepted an appearance on Larry King Live, getting questions on the phone from curious people. Some are jokers and others are more sincere. It's all the same besides, they don't take you seriously. As the call ends before an ad break, you espouse out your true beliefs. Unaware to you, you're on a hot mic and the break hasn't necessarily started yet. Something that hundreds of thousands of people will hear.\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 951, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"The entire campaign you've positioned yourself as the 'law and order' candidate and a message as inticing as that has certainly gotten heads your way. Your way of speaking about the slums of New York and how you're going to root out the welfare cheats and 'go hard on the thugs and looters destroying the inner city'.<br>To make things even better, your campaign has just thought up a brilliant way to show the difference between you and Dukakis on the crime issue: prison furloughs. Previously Al Gore brought it up during the primaries, but shoring it up couldn't hurt could it?<br>What do you think?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 952, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"This campaign has been the most boring one in existence hasn't it? Babbitt is showing off his plans, his charts and graphs, he's like a professor speaking to people. It doesn't help that people are visibly tired during his speeches, but it seems this pointdexter is in trouble now.<br>Labor unions and liberals have been very upfront about their unease at Babbitt's candidacy, promoting welfare cuts would do that. Not just that, but his strike-breaking during his time as governor has not done him any favors. Perhaps something to talk about?<br>What do you think?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 953, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"It just seems like Hart is untouchable. Every attack is seen as desperate pleas for support. Every time he smiles the people can't help but just fawn for this Kennedy-in-waiting. Yet, what has just been exposed to papers nationwide might be the biggest gift you could ask for.<br>The press, after much insistence from Hart himself, have taken photos of him alongside a lady on his lap near a yacht named Monkey Business. This is perhaps the biggest political scandal in recent memory, and you'd be dumb to not take advantage.<br>What do you think?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}]");

campaignTrail_temp.questions_json = JSON.parse("[{\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 698, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 1, \"description\": \"After New Hampshire and Iowa, George Bush seems to be on the backfoot and what was to be a coronation is a bid for survival. With Super Tuesday in the distance, this could be the moment your campaign goes into serious consideration.\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 699, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 2, \"description\": \"From a series of victories after March, the primary map is not looking too favorable for your odds. With the certainty of a Bush nomination up in the air, this is definitely your make or break moment. What's the plan going forward?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 711, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 3, \"description\": \"It seems to be anyones game right now, and Bush and his apparatus are hinging on considerable performances in the late primaries to keep their man in his spot. Considering this, the attack ads and smears from all sides is dialed up to its extreme. He's getting desperate as it seems like you have a low chance at actually being the nominee.\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 700, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 3, \"description\": \"It's the faint beginnings of the Republican National Convention in Louisiana, and it seems that it'll go to balloting for the first time since 1976. Tensions are high between the camps, but how the convention comes out is unclear. What will you do?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 756, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 3, \"description\": \"Things have been going so well for you as the balloting continues, but there's a problem emerging. The credentials for your delegates are coming into question. Some debating the authenticity for some of your delegates. Controversially, the committee dealing with the credentials are throwing out your supporters under the assumption that they're invalid.<br>Things are getting heated on the ground, and your chance at the nomination are dwindling as delegates are shown the door. You need to think, fast.\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 703, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"You've shocked Republicans and people throughout the country. You actually succeeded in being the nominee! The Robertson delegation is ecstatic, but everyone else is despondent. As speakers finish their speeches to applause, it's finally time for your moment to shine. This is your defining moment, what will be your message to the party?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 701, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"RUNNING MATE QUESTION\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 705, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"Many polls this early have shown a deficit for your campaign by disproportionate levels. Even after the convention wrapped up and getting a bounce, it's still a dire situation that Republicans are in.<br>What will be your strategy to address the overall environment?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 713, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"Your campaign is set to hire a number of figures that'll really even out the odds. It'll take time, however, so it's best to set foot around an area and make an impression. Where would you like to hold your first set of rallies?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 706, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"DEMOCRATIC CANDIDATE QUESTION\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 754, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"Your campaign made for good fodder from the television networks and nosy journalists. Your service during Korea, inflammatory statements, bigoted comments, and most importantly your child from wedlock. They are certainly salivating at continuing to poke at you, and continue to disparage your campaign. How would you like to address these attacks?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 708, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"With a people that feel as if they're prosperous, due to the fundamentals of the economy appearing to be steady and strong, it would've been a slam dunk for the incumbent Republican. Unfortunately, you have a lot of flaws.<br>How would you like to tackle the economy?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 704, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"Through the Reagan Administration the federal deficit has ballooned to an incredible degree. Due to the massive expenditures into the defense budget and federal spending, many Americans are opining it as a major issue this campaign.<br>What is your plan to tackle the budget deficit?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 749, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"An issue that has gotten out of control (at least in the public consciousness) is the decay of the inner cities. Crime is at all-time highs, drugs are rampant, and corruption is far-reaching. Confidence is low, and desperate for anyone to stop this crime-wave.<br>Republicans have the edge on the issue, but what will be your policies on crime prevention?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 707, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"DEMOCRATIC CANDIDATE QUESTION\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 743, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"During your career in broadcasting and the initial primaries, your source of funding came from small donors. Those that loyally send a $100 check every month and well, here you are!<br>Despite that, you can't solely rely on the grass-roots and party donors aren't willing to support you.<br>How will you handle your campaign's finances going forward?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 742, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"RUNNING MATE QUESTION\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 745, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"An issue a majority of Republicans are lockstep on is foreign policy. Holding the line for Reagan's increases in Defense and defending liberty in the backyard abroad. You're no different, perhaps a bit too much of a hawk for your own good.<br>How would you best describe your foreign affairs posture?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 753, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"Another day, another rally to get the movement and energy of this race on your side. One thing that's certainly troubling to Republicans are the party's seats in the Senate and House in free-fall. This could be your moment to redeem yourself.<br>Where would you like to rally?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 712, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 4, \"description\": \"DEMOCRATIC CANDIDATE QUESTION\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 709, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 5, \"description\": \"DEMOCRATIC CANDIDATE QUESTION\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 751, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 5, \"description\": \"Remember that lawsuit you waged against Pete McCloskey during the onset of the primaries? He's willing to voice his time in the military to any talking head willing to listen, and printers can't get enough of it. Despite the settlement you two agreed to, you've got to address these strong attacks on your character.<br>How are you going to address these exaggerations to your military service during the Korean War?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 747, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 5, \"description\": \"A core plank in your campaign has been your hardline stance on abortion. While this invigorates your base, this brings the scorn from practically everyone else. Fellow Republicans are nervous even standing next to you with the implications.<br>What will be your position on the hot button issue?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 702, \"fields\": {\"priority\": 5, \"description\": \"While your campaign has had hiccups with maintaining momentum, the consultants you hired for advertising is a different story entirely. Practically one of the few carrying your campaign from defeat, they're the crack team that you have to thank.<br>With a few spots set for your approval, which would you like to prioritize first?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 755, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"RUNNING MATE QUESTION\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 908, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"The crux of your campaign has been saving the country from itself. You've waged war against what you claim is 'moral rot'. While your base is enthused at your strident messaging, the broader public are confused as to what this means.<br>Could you clarify what you meant by 'moral rot'?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 935, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"Another day, another rally to get the movement and energy of this race on your side. It seems that some figures have reached out for once letting you know they're willing to campaign by your side.<br>With the debate coming up soon, now would be the good time to get some momentum.<br>Who would you like to rally with?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 909, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"DEMOCRATIC CANDIDATE QUESTION\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 910, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"It's the second debate and your calm demeanor during the first has shown an uptick in your favorability. Things might finally be going your way until the moderator, Bernard Shaw, starts off the debate with a question to you. All eyes are on you.<br>“If Lisa Robertson were raped and she were to seek abortive care, should she pursue this as an option?”\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 911, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"After that, quite frankly disastrous, debate your campaign has tinkered with how to win back support from voters after the debacle. They believe they've found just that issue and it's one that has been the consensus of the 80s.<br>What will be your tax policy?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 913, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"When there were fears of the Social Security fund becoming insolvent in the early 80s, legislation was written up that patched up some problems to keep it solvent. Retirement age increases and payroll taxes increases to keep the system intact.<br>It's still a concern for voters, so what will be your approach to Social Security?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 937, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"One of your more explicit planks is support for a prayer amendment.<br>Allowing children, particularly Christians, to be able to organize prayers during school hours. This has been outlawed since the 60s by the Supreme Court, but pushback from people such as yourself has made this a prominent issue.<br>What will be your stance on such an amendment?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 938, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"OCTOBER SURPRISE\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 939, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"MODERATE REPUBLICANS\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.question\", \"pk\": 912, \"fields\": {\"priority\": -1, \"description\": \"This will be your final rally as soon after you and your campaign bunker down at the CBN headquarters in Virginia Beach.<br>While the polls have consitently shown your Democratic opponent as the winner, underdogs should never be underestimated.<br>Where would you like to rally to send off your campaign?\", \"likelihood\": 1.0}}]");

campaignTrail_temp.answers_json = JSON.parse("[{\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4366, \"fields\": {\"question\": 698, \"description\": \"We creamed Bush in Iowa and we'll do so again in South Carolina. A victory there will give us the momentum going forward.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4367, \"fields\": {\"question\": 698, \"description\": \"I need to firmly establish myself as the conservative candidate. Bush is just a wimp with no skin in the game, and a real no nonsense conservative will actually get things done that the Vice President and his handlers aren't willing to acknowledge.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4368, \"fields\": {\"question\": 698, \"description\": \"South Carolina is nearly guranteed, but we need to look further out from the woods. Everyone's doubting me, but they won't when we snatch all these states from ol' Bush.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4369, \"fields\": {\"question\": 698, \"description\": \"Now that we're going to get some real energy behind me, I need to show my serious side. All the smears from the tabloids and talking heads, taking my words out of context. People just got to know I'm reasonable, not some hothead with a Bible.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4370, \"fields\": {\"question\": 699, \"description\": \"Don't doubt what He has planned for us. With our investments into the infrastructure, we'll be competitive and that's what matters. The convention is the goal, trust the process.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4371, \"fields\": {\"question\": 699, \"description\": \"Now that I have victories under my belt, it's now time to take Bush down a peg. He's got a lot to answer for. Let the people see his treasonous colors. Just keep it separate from the president himself. Let's not get too carried away now.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4372, \"fields\": {\"question\": 699, \"description\": \"I keep on seeing these lousy reporters, they just can't stop doubting me. Give me a break! I just need to show my seriousness, I actually have plans and an agenda for America. They keep on deflecting, ruining my reputation. Revise the platform, put more focus on the numbers than the rhetoric. The base will understand.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4373, \"fields\": {\"question\": 700, \"description\": \"From what Nuttle has said, Bush and Dole are trying to get things forward but we all know it's going nowhere. Dole'll certainly not like those attacks on his record. They're forgetting the other candidates, but I can get them in my lane.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4374, \"fields\": {\"question\": 700, \"description\": \"We're going to not do a thing. I'll keep my options open as the balloting goes on. If Bush and Dole's guys want to know where I stand, they can come to me.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4375, \"fields\": {\"question\": 700, \"description\": \"This is the best case scenario, everything is going according to plan. Great, fantastic. Where are my true supporters? Everywhere. Now's the time to show how serious we are.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4379, \"fields\": {\"question\": 702, \"description\": \"VALUES - People still misunderstand me, it's ludicrous. We need to showcase what I'm running for. The uplifting of the American family, promoting social cohesion, and ultimately make sure America is the global standard. I'm not some radical like some have talked.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4380, \"fields\": {\"question\": 702, \"description\": \"DEMOCRACY - The entire world order is on the brink. We're seeing how the Soviet Union operates, playing a game of chess while we're playing checkers. The liberators of democracy need our full support, and America with all it's might will do so to protect the world.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4381, \"fields\": {\"question\": 702, \"description\": \"TAXES - The economy has been in an upswing. We've seen the wages of the working man, businesses boom and build up communities. When you see the Democrats' tax plan, it's really crazy! Imagine less of your wage for the same labor? I can assure you, your taxes will be low.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5014, \"fields\": {\"question\": 702, \"description\": \"RONALD REAGAN - Republicans are still antsy about me, give me a break! I'm Reagan's successor and these 'conservatives' need to get in line. How about show off his accomplishments and how I'll be the one to continue it. Imagine if Democrats get in office? That's a choice we just can't make.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4382, \"fields\": {\"question\": 703, \"description\": \"I want to make a branch to my fellow members. We are all Republicans. We each believe in free enterprise, a strong military, and a strong economy. Only Republicans have given us these things, and I intend to follow in the president's direction.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4383, \"fields\": {\"question\": 703, \"description\": \"There's a problem in America. One that has bubbled to catastrophic levels. There's a rot in our institutions, our society, our people. It's an advocation for a swerve into the unknown. I implore, my fellow Americans, we will fight against this rot.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4384, \"fields\": {\"question\": 703, \"description\": \"I want to show people that this isn't my candidacy. I'm only thankful for the party to select me as their candidate for the race, but I'm running as an example. The values of America are a Christian document. I will start my speech with a prayer to celebrate this moment.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5001, \"fields\": {\"question\": 703, \"description\": \"This is a fight for the soul of America. We're seeing what Americans can do with freedom, pure and unadulterated. We want to see all Americans, to see uplifted and prosperous. Through smart conservative governance, we will continue the work that Ronald Reagan has done.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4385, \"fields\": {\"question\": 704, \"description\": \"We're going to, as a country, need to make tough decisions. When we operate the country like a credit card, you sooner or later don't have enough credit! Basic families have this figured out. I'm going to take a look at all these programs and expenses and I'll tell you right now. Government needs downsizing!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4386, \"fields\": {\"question\": 704, \"description\": \"You know the common sense way to get this whole budget talk dealt with? I'll give you two words. Budget amendment. The time for fiscal prudence needs to be addressed, and only through making sure our budgets are like the family will we see it.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4387, \"fields\": {\"question\": 704, \"description\": \"Look. It's a tough pill to swallow, but we need to make structural reforms to our system. We need an executive that puts their foot down and says enough is enough! The so called taboos of reform shouldn't be out of the question, they'll be necessary one way or another.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4388, \"fields\": {\"question\": 705, \"description\": \"This is nonsense. The people of this country put their trust in me, and I don't aim to disappoint. Getting these people into the ranks is my priority, everything else is secondary. Soon, I envision a Republican party that voices the concerns of concerned families.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4389, \"fields\": {\"question\": 705, \"description\": \"The Republican apparatus doesn't have trust in me, and dang it that's just so unfortunate. I need the party resources to truly take on these Democrats. Put out a line on leadership, and tell them I'm willing to give them influence in my administration.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4390, \"fields\": {\"question\": 705, \"description\": \"What we need to make this race isn't about me and my opponent, but the values we hold. I'm the candidate for the majority. Low taxes, upright values, and common sense. The Democrats, however, are the candidates of crime, immorality, and high taxes. This isn't hard to understand.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5002, \"fields\": {\"question\": 705, \"description\": \"There's a clear problem, I'm still decently unknown to a decent amount of Americans. Yet when given more information, see my unfavorability go up. This is just a bunch of slander. Let's write up some material about my background. Once Americans know me, they'll see me positively.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4395, \"fields\": {\"question\": 708, \"description\": \"We're going to take the Reagan economy and run with it. That's what differentiates us from the Democrats, we get things done and prosper Americans. All Democrats know is a bunch of tax raising and fuzzy math, talk about crazy!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4396, \"fields\": {\"question\": 708, \"description\": \"What we need is to put the onus on those Democrats. Remember the Carter years? Yeah, that's what's going to happen once they're in office. Paint some imagery of rustic cities, abandoned mills, all that. Get these ads running boys.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5012, \"fields\": {\"question\": 708, \"description\": \"Enough is enough! It's getting tiring being portrayed as some sort of 'idiot with all this Jesus talk'. I'm going to show off the Robertson program and who's going to be laughing in the end? I'll tell you what. It won't be these talking heads that's for sure!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4402, \"fields\": {\"question\": 711, \"description\": \"The handlers are getting really desperate aren't they? Bringing up my relationship to my wife, that whole lawsuit, my own words. Let's show those two two can play at that game. Iran-Contra, the tax raises, surrendering to the Soviets. They stand for nothing, I'm the only real option.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4403, \"fields\": {\"question\": 711, \"description\": \"We can't forget it's about one thing and one thing only, winning. The road to just that is California. There's a reckoning against the establishment from all Americans, and this is going to cement just that.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5000, \"fields\": {\"question\": 711, \"description\": \"The base is our hope, nothing else matters. Bush has already been shifting his rhetoric, but it isn't good enough for our people. Hold the line, keep going, and continue our work on getting these people to entrench themselves. I have a feeling, just believe me.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4405, \"fields\": {\"question\": 713, \"description\": \"If we're going to really make a mark, we're going to show that my coalition isn't contained to a small group of the population. It encompasses the entire nation, and we'll make this case in New York where all groups will hear my message. A couple of volunteers have a good song for the moment.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4406, \"fields\": {\"question\": 713, \"description\": \"Something that Nuttle notified me about are the cross tabs that are advantageous for our campaign. For every Republican that voted, those that recently joined made up a significant share of it. This is what we're going to be targeting, and the industrious states are where they are.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5010, \"fields\": {\"question\": 713, \"description\": \"I need to assauge concerns from these Republicans. They think I'm bad for business, that I'm going to tank all of Reagan's accomplishments. This is a bunch of crazy talk. All the rallies and shaking hands can wait. I want meetings with leadership, and they'll certainly come around.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5011, \"fields\": {\"question\": 713, \"description\": \"Excuse me? Who needs to set foot in a state, that's wasting resources and time. My experience in broadcasting tells me one thing, we need to set up tele-rallies! I can get my points with ease and spread my message more effectively. What do these Republicans know?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4481, \"fields\": {\"question\": 743, \"description\": \"These people have put their trust in me believing that we, as a moral people, will build a more moral America. I will continue the course, see that we combine our donor list from The 700 Club and our campaign. I'm sure they're willing to dole out some more for the cause.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4482, \"fields\": {\"question\": 743, \"description\": \"I've seen the finances and what's there to worry about? We're above board and I certainly have more than enough to take a hit from my personal finances. Look, if we're going to get all worried how about this: $1,000. I can count on our people to keep this ship afloat.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4483, \"fields\": {\"question\": 743, \"description\": \"As much as my brigade of supporters have held the line, we need far more resources to properly compete with my opponent. Republicans voted for me and they need to get in line. They have concerns of the platform? Lets hear them out, but I'll hold reservations.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4489, \"fields\": {\"question\": 745, \"description\": \"We're in a war, and I mean this sincerely. Nobody likes that word, but it's true. Western civilization is at stake from the bolshevik forces. We must defend liberty, we must defeat the red menace. Only through supporting allies in this spiritual fight, will we succeed. Amen.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4490, \"fields\": {\"question\": 745, \"description\": \"Everyone knows I'm going to be tough on these communists, but we need to clean up shop. All these bureaucrats in the State Department? Gotta go! They believe in outdated principles, it just doesn't make sense. Why does the executive got to work with officials from previous administrations?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4491, \"fields\": {\"question\": 745, \"description\": \"When I was in the jungles of Nicaragua helping the freedom fighters that were fighting for their countries, the refugees that were displaced by those communist Sandinistas. It just makes me tear up thinking about it. As executive, I'll step my foot down and aid all causes in defense of democracy.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4495, \"fields\": {\"question\": 747, \"description\": \"This is a fight that's absolutely worth fighting for. The unborn, the blooming of life, the innocence that He gave to us. To kill them is cruel, and we must ban this cruel practice. We cannot compromise, because the baby-killers certainly don't.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4496, \"fields\": {\"question\": 747, \"description\": \"My position is clear, but what my campaign's been telling me it's a losing issue. I can cut back on the abortion talk. Though if I'm going to leave out an issue I'm passionate about, I'll allude to it. The Supreme Court needs good scholarly judges that won't just interpret from thin air.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4497, \"fields\": {\"question\": 747, \"description\": \"When we're talking about these things, we're often talking about the act and not the cause. We're seeing a decay in the family unit. Instead of mom and dad you get a single mother collecting welfare checks and living in their subsidized home. It's cruel, and we need to go at the source. If we promote policies that promote familial cohesion, abortion won't be an option.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4501, \"fields\": {\"question\": 749, \"description\": \"This whole crime epidemic is out of control, our streets are turning into concrete jungles! We're going to say enough is enough, and amp up funding for all these states. Thugs want to loot and pillage? SWAT isn't going to ask questions I'll tell you that!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4502, \"fields\": {\"question\": 749, \"description\": \"I differ from my Republican colleagues. As I see this deeply unfortunate problem with a two-pronged approach. Increase funding for private institutions paired with police funding is common sense. Those on the ground know much more than an overreaching government.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4503, \"fields\": {\"question\": 749, \"description\": \"I'm the tough-on crime candidate, that much is simple to state. What we've got to do, however, is just tell the people what the Democrats support. They want revolving criminals, they want our youth shooting up on the streets, they even want us to pay for criminal's exits! Get these ads rolling people.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4506, \"fields\": {\"question\": 751, \"description\": \"That washed up congressman, he sure has a lot of nerve! Kick me while I'm down, but you won't like it when I get up. This is a personal matter, not involved with my campaign whatsoever. He's going to see me in court again, and he'll be kicking up rocks when all is said and done.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4507, \"fields\": {\"question\": 751, \"description\": \"Why does McCloskey got to go ahead and ruin a good thing? He got good money from the settlement, money out of my pockets! He should be grateful. I'll address these spurious accusations of my service in Korea. One giant conference, as many journalists that can fit, and give the real story.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5013, \"fields\": {\"question\": 751, \"description\": \"It's just so tiresome. I fought with valor and dignity during Korea. What McCloskey's saying, it's a disrespect of the veterans that fought for democratic Korea. Ignore him, but I'm thinking of some ad spots. Showing off my early days. Yes, that'll be good.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4511, \"fields\": {\"question\": 753, \"description\": \"The polls are just false, false with nothing of substance. You don't need the pointdexters telling you what to do, you do it yourself. I've seen the numbers in the South, my turf. We're not going to let it get into the hands of these false conservatives.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4512, \"fields\": {\"question\": 753, \"description\": \"I don't believe in polls, I believe in results. Those are going to show a majority that are being missed, the 'Silent Brigade' as the press say. Fertile ground needs to be cemented and the industrial states were most responsive to my message. We're paying them a visit.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4513, \"fields\": {\"question\": 753, \"description\": \"These polls can just be thrown out because it's all fuzzy math. Especially California, do you see the discrepancy between me and my opponent? It's nonsense, but we're going to prove them wrong. Let's get something hopeful, someone recommended me... New Traditionalists? Sounds fitting!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4514, \"fields\": {\"question\": 753, \"description\": \"I can't be everywhere all at once, I don't have the power that He does. I wish! Though we have an avenue that nobody's expecting, satellite TV! It'll cost a pretty penny, but once we got it all situated we can 'barnstorm' these states with ease. I'm such a genius.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4515, \"fields\": {\"question\": 754, \"description\": \"The best course of action is not giving them any oxygen. These downright evil people don't deserve the time of day. Get some security, list the names, and make sure these people don't step foot near me.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4516, \"fields\": {\"question\": 754, \"description\": \"All these attacks, He is making me come out stronger. I must address the most egregious of these claims. My first child, who I love dearly, should not be talked about. Shame on the press and the Democrats, I demand they apologize. This is a private matter, not public.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4517, \"fields\": {\"question\": 754, \"description\": \"I want to make a public example of these disgusting lies. Get one of these rags, doesn't matter which one. We're taking them to court for libel, and they'll certainly all come to regret disparaging my name.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4523, \"fields\": {\"question\": 756, \"description\": \"What they're doing is downright wicked. They want to steal this from me. They know I'm winning, and they want to take it away from me. My manager's telling me that he's getting everything sorted. He better be, or I'm going to see my options after this convention.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 4524, \"fields\": {\"question\": 756, \"description\": \"This whole monkey business is getting too bad, I want it finished and finished quickly. Nuttle, you there? Challenge the committee on their bogus rules. Challenge these credentials disuputes. They want to bring me down? We're not going down without a fight, I assure them that.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5037, \"fields\": {\"question\": 900, \"description\": \"It's an honor to be the party's candidate for president. Under the current administration, it's perhaps the most criminal in the nation's history. Even more so than Nixon's. This underreaction from the president says a lot. It's time to turn a new leaf my friends.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5038, \"fields\": {\"question\": 900, \"description\": \"When Ronald Reagan told us it would be 'morning in America' when he was elected, that seems to be far from the case. The federal deficit has ballooned to an extreme degree, and I'll tell you that cutting social programs isn't the solution. I'll navigate the course, and do so swimmingly.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5039, \"fields\": {\"question\": 900, \"description\": \"So called 'Reaganomics' has been a disaster. If the S&L Crash didn't showcase this, then the Farm Crisis that has shut multiple family farms due to the government's inaction certainly shows this. Meanwhile due to the 'Massachusetts Miracle', we saw increases to the people's wellbeing.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5040, \"fields\": {\"question\": 900, \"description\": \"It's a shame to see how captured the Republicans seem to be with Pat Robertson's candidacy. Just like in 1964, Barry Goldwater stated that extremism isn't a vice. I fear Robertson will be the same. To the Republicans scared off, I lend my hand to you.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5003, \"fields\": {\"question\": 903, \"description\": \"As a nation in moral decline, we must have an example for everyone to follow. That's why I've selected the senator from Idaho because he's a fellow conservative like, like all of us. We're the party of conservative values, and we're going to show that off on the campaign trail!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5080, \"fields\": {\"question\": 903, \"description\": \"Come on up Steve! Show everyone what you're all about. Your a no nonsense type of conservative ain't ya? We've got a lot in common, and that's what makes this ticket strong. Our ideological commitment will show that conservatism is the label to wear. Show 'em your credentials why don't ya?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5081, \"fields\": {\"question\": 903, \"description\": \"We're going to show these liberals what's what aren't we? They talk about how radical we are. Are we radical? Or are they simply talking crazy talk trying to brainwash people to their ideology? We both see liberals for what they are, and we're going to take the fight right to 'em!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5004, \"fields\": {\"question\": 904, \"description\": \"Quayle seems like a swell guy, and he's got quite the record as senator. His loyalty to the party is something that's commendable, one which I'm happy to showcase with him by my side. We're going to be continuing Reagan's term, and we're going to do a swell job!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5082, \"fields\": {\"question\": 904, \"description\": \"When I was looking for a candidate to be by my side, I wanted to showcase what my vision for America is. Dan Quayle perfectly illustrates this clearly. Conservatism is what the youth are into, and he's our conduit to the current culture.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5083, \"fields\": {\"question\": 904, \"description\": \"I mean look at the guy! Quayle has the looks of a president, you'd think I were the running mate. While I'm out stumping out in the states, Quayle's looking good for the television. If I had to make a prediction, he's our Jack Kennedy!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5005, \"fields\": {\"question\": 905, \"description\": \"Jack and I aren't so opposed ideologically despite what the talking heads and press would have you believe. Why don't you come on up here Jack? Show 'em you mean business! We're going to take the fight against the Democrats on ideas.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5084, \"fields\": {\"question\": 905, \"description\": \"When thinking of who I wanted, I wanted someone that's knowledgeable with the process and Kemp is just that man. I mean he got Reagan's tax cuts through and signed. If that doesn't show how good he is, then I don't know what would.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5085, \"fields\": {\"question\": 905, \"description\": \"I'll tell you right here, right now. Our administration will be the most proactive in history, and Kemp is my card to show how serious I am. He's got the technical points down, and we're going to work side by side to make real positive change for the nation.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5006, \"fields\": {\"question\": 906, \"description\": \"Laxalt and I share the same fear in the encroachment of communism. We're seeing the Soviets invade Afghanistan, devastating the resistant people of Eastern Europe, we're going to put our foot down. I have a message for the Soviet Union, we're not going to take it!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5086, \"fields\": {\"question\": 906, \"description\": \"Come up here Laxalt! Show 'em what your about, show 'em what your bringing to this campaign. You've got quite a record don't ya? We're going to show just how serious this administration is going to be. No one's going to be laughing when we're done!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5087, \"fields\": {\"question\": 906, \"description\": \"While Reagan's presidency is going to come to a close, that doesn't mean it's officially over. With Paul Laxalt by my side, we're going to show I mean business when I want to work with Republicans. Now that I think about it, some cabinet appointees would be nice to stay with me.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5007, \"fields\": {\"question\": 907, \"description\": \"This convention has been going on for too long. Just look for anyone, I don't care who. Find someone that ticks all the right boxes for me and we can get this over and done with.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5019, \"fields\": {\"question\": 908, \"description\": \"The rot is around us. Look at the streets, look at our industry, just look everywhere. Everything is falling apart. It's a disgrace, and our justice system lets this continue. A revolving door for the thugs and cheats, we're going to clean up the streets.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5020, \"fields\": {\"question\": 908, \"description\": \"Whenever I talk about this, all these talking heads just take things out of context. It's ridiculous! It's about the soul of the nation, our judeo-Christian values are fading in favor of Scientism. His values which have built strong nations and people, this is matter of fact. That's what I mean.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5021, \"fields\": {\"question\": 908, \"description\": \"Everyone knows what I mean by that. When you put on the TV for your kids, you expect family friendly entertainment while you do your chores. Instead, they get exposed to these decadent lifestyles that brainwash them. It's all types of wrong, and I'm not going to take it. Music, movies, television, everything needs to be toned down from the degeneracy they publish.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5022, \"fields\": {\"question\": 935, \"description\": \"Jerry Falwell - Falwell and I jive on a lot of things. It's only common sense that we get with each other and show the power of our movement.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5023, \"fields\": {\"question\": 935, \"description\": \"Evan Mecham - There's that Arizona governor that's getting on those Democrats gears. That's hilarious, and what more than make these people rage some more with an appearance side by side with him.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5024, \"fields\": {\"question\": 935, \"description\": \"Ronald Reagan - We need one grand appearance from the Gipper himself. Everyone loves him, everyone supports him. Appearing alongside him will finally get the message across. Get some music ready for the occasion.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5025, \"fields\": {\"question\": 935, \"description\": \"Trent Lott - That Senate seat in Mississippi is looking awfully close isn't it? Why don't I go over there and show Lott some support. He's already been one of my few true supporters within the party. Ought to pay the favor.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5026, \"fields\": {\"question\": 911, \"description\": \"When it comes to taxes I'll make it clear where I put my line on the sand. I took that pledge and I'll stand by it. The reckless Democrats'll push tax increases and I'll say no and no matter how many times I'll reject it. Here are my words to them, no new taxes.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5027, \"fields\": {\"question\": 911, \"description\": \"What Republicans have been able to get done has been the success story of a lifetime. We took from the disaster Jimmy Carter caused and we've boomed the economy. Ronald Reagan is the template, and I promise that taxes are going to get lower. Trickle-down economics works people!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5028, \"fields\": {\"question\": 911, \"description\": \"What my tax program is about? It's a continuation of the Reagan boom. What about those Democrats? They're all about raising the taxes for services that aren't even efficent! Look at the destitute cities and come back to me. Get some ad spots ready.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5029, \"fields\": {\"question\": 913, \"description\": \"Is it alright if I just don't say anything? I can see already the attacks from those Democrats will throw at me. It's all nonsense! Let's focus on more substantial topics such as reforming other social programs. It'll be much more tolerable than touching the fund.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5030, \"fields\": {\"question\": 913, \"description\": \"When speaking of Social Security, we need to think less of the consequences and more what can be done to help our people. We need pair a privatized form of the fund, so that those that choose to invest into the stock market they'll get their due payment without all the government interference. This is what I'll pursue as executive.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5151, \"fields\": {\"question\": 913, \"description\": \"The fund isn't the problem, it's the inherent imbalances that'll creat such a shortfall to the detriment to citizens. If we're going to be serious about tackling this, we need to uplift American families and get them to be economically productive. Then when they're of age, they won't be as dependent on the fund than beforehand.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5152, \"fields\": {\"question\": 937, \"description\": \"We got the government funding abortions, alternative lifestyles degrading social cohesion, public drug use on the streets. You'd think we were the slums of East Europe! A school prayer amendment is the least of our concerns, and we're going to support morality.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5153, \"fields\": {\"question\": 937, \"description\": \"When you see these politicians talking about people being opposed to the amendment, you know they're lying. People understand that letting children practice their faith is harmless. Yet the court is going to tell us we can't do that? The hypocrisy, it's unbelievable.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5154, \"fields\": {\"question\": 937, \"description\": \"It's alright, a plurality support such an amendment. What we need to do is put the onus on the Democrats. Why are they trying to dictate our children's beliefs? This is the problem with public education, it instills Scientism rather than established facts.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5155, \"fields\": {\"question\": 910, \"description\": \"That's a disgusting question Mr. Shaw. Why are you, and the rest of the deplorable press, constantly pressing me? I love my daughter, my wife, my family and the fact that you people have to make me make a decision on baby-murder is disturbing. Shame on you, that's all I have to say.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5156, \"fields\": {\"question\": 910, \"description\": \"It's a difficult question and one I hope none of us have to contend with. Rape is horrible and He will punish the defiler for disturbing God's sacred flower. That's the state of our country. We need a moral leader in the executive, and I'm just that man. Thank you.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5157, \"fields\": {\"question\": 910, \"description\": \"These are tough questions, some of which we've had to answer for. Fortunately, I haven't but I would put it simply. Children are God's gift to the world and there is a certain type of evil to extinguish that gift. This has been my position and I would never deflect from it.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5088, \"fields\": {\"question\": 901, \"description\": \"Our nation is in trouble, it's in trouble from it's expansive deficit. Today, as I speak, the deficit will get bigger. Isn't this a problem? Why aren't Republicans doing anything substantial about it? When I'm in office, I'll take the challenge and actually get America's budget back in order.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5089, \"fields\": {\"question\": 901, \"description\": \"We, as a country, have to take care of the destitute and downtrodden. The problem comes, however, when our social services are strained beyond their capacities. This is a real problem and I ensure to plug the holes through means-testing. So that those that need it, get it.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5090, \"fields\": {\"question\": 901, \"description\": \"When we're thinking of our standing on the global stage, we're thinking of the interior rather than the outside. Let's take a look at it. Our industrial capacity is dwarfed compared to Europe, Japan, China. How's that so? The trickle-down theory has rotted and I will negotiate competitively at the table.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5091, \"fields\": {\"question\": 901, \"description\": \"There's so much to discuss it almost seems difficult to pick and choose. This campaign is a step towards the future, in which we put work into new ideas and see it take off. Let's show off the planks and show how we're going to get America moving again!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5041, \"fields\": {\"question\": 902, \"description\": \"As we look into the future, we must look at ourselves. The current government program, has proven to be very ineffective at tackling the issues core to the people. I say no to that, and instead, want a new outlook. A bold vision for the future in which all Americans benefit and not just the top.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5042, \"fields\": {\"question\": 902, \"description\": \"Our children are the core to the future, but their education is massively lacking. When we see the public schools, they're in desperate need of investment. Through investing now into education, we will see bold innovations into the future.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5043, \"fields\": {\"question\": 902, \"description\": \"I want to see a world of peace, of love instead of bombs. We can get this done, we truly can, if we truly be bold and invest into new technologies and industry. The world market is competitive, our markets are lucrative, and through table talks with allies and foes we can truly get things rolling.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5044, \"fields\": {\"question\": 902, \"description\": \"Everyone wants a bold and new leader. With respect to the president, the ideas of old are outdated. Of trickle-down, mass armament, and exclusion. We need new, fresh ideas to help the people. Ladies and gentlemen, I'm the candidate of a new vision.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5045, \"fields\": {\"question\": 954, \"description\": \"A lot of this is a smokescreen. Behind the veneer is a man using his faith to mislead the people into hate. No moral man would say such things to another person of faith. Instead I'll open my arms for all Americans. I will work with others to form a consensus, and therefore help all Americans.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5046, \"fields\": {\"question\": 954, \"description\": \"The dirt that Robertson's throwing is just plain tiring. I'm a socialist? I hate America? I tried to legalize sodomy in Massachusetts? This is just ridiculous. I condemn this level of mud slinging, and implore Republicans to do so as well.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5047, \"fields\": {\"question\": 954, \"description\": \"What he's saying is so obviously ludicrous. If anyone takes him seriously, then I think they'd need to contemplate their process to come to that conclusion. I'll go on anyways. People don't want a dirty campaign, they want a president that'll bring them results.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5048, \"fields\": {\"question\": 917, \"description\": \"If you take a look at my record, in conservative Arizona no less, you'd see what I was able to get done. I got the legislature to pass my plans, which led to a budget that was responsible. If that doesn't showcase how I'll get things done, then I don't know what will.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5049, \"fields\": {\"question\": 917, \"description\": \"My whole life I've always stood up for the voices that couldn't speak up for themselves. I've worked to improve civil rights my whole career as an attorney and especially as governor. I intend to do so when president, and raise everyone's boats. Is Robertson really against equality?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5050, \"fields\": {\"question\": 917, \"description\": \"Let's take a look at my policy prescriptions. Means-testing social programs, putting education at the forefront, actually tackling the budget deficit. I can go on and on, yet Robertson has nothing of substance. This race is about ideas, and it's clear he's failing in that regard.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5051, \"fields\": {\"question\": 921, \"description\": \"When you look at two visions for America you get two distinct outlooks. One puts us into the medieval age and the other the future. Which one seems appealing? I know we must move forward, and a bold vision for America is what I'm proposing.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5052, \"fields\": {\"question\": 921, \"description\": \"It's almost ridiculous how fixated Robertson is with the past. I admit it, I had my name changed. Hart sounds more appealing than Hartpence doesn't it? We need our sights set on the future, and these are only distractions from that bridge. You gotta have Hart folks!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5053, \"fields\": {\"question\": 921, \"description\": \"It's true that my campaign in 1984 has led me to have some debt still owed to the FEC. There's been a lot of talk about that, but I'll make it clear. My campaign is for the people, and by the people. I've rejected PAC money then, and I deny it again. I have people's support and that's all I need.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5054, \"fields\": {\"question\": 922, \"description\": \"I want to square keenly on Robertson's policy prescriptions. Just how achievable is all of what he spits out of his mouth. I'll tell you as a man that's been behind the scenes in Congress, nothing. It all won't happen and he's just preaching to the choir here.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5055, \"fields\": {\"question\": 922, \"description\": \"I want this to be a comparison of us as candidates. I'm boldly selling the future and what we can achieve if we invest today, and Robertson wants nothing but what's been tried before. Where's the energy? We're America, we can get things done if we put our mind to it!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5056, \"fields\": {\"question\": 922, \"description\": \"We've kept our ad spots focused on me, but it's time we go into attack mode. He's got a lot of controversial statements he's made right? Just compile them all together and show just how unhinged he is as a candidate.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5057, \"fields\": {\"question\": 923, \"description\": \"I want to make a case for renewal. When we need help, we truly need help. It doesn't come when the system is burdened by too many cases. I call for a look into means-testing some of our social programs. So that the poor, instead of the rich and middle-class truly get those resources.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5058, \"fields\": {\"question\": 923, \"description\": \"There's a case I have to make. We need competent governance, one that the people can truly believe in. Integrity and honesty are what I'm running for. The White House needs a new man that's up to par with this generation. In touch with the concerns of the people.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5059, \"fields\": {\"question\": 923, \"description\": \"Our cities are facing problems, that is correct. What isn't happening are these broad exagerations that Robertson is spilling. He's calling cities warzones. Really? If we actually invest into these decaying communities, standards rise and are ready for the future.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5060, \"fields\": {\"question\": 923, \"description\": \"There's really no need to do so. I've said all I can say, and the Democratic apparatus will do the work for me. I want to inspire people, to get people really invested into the future. A vision with no support isn't a vision at all.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5092, \"fields\": {\"question\": 919, \"description\": \"Remember when Social Security was projected to be insolvent relatively soon if action was not taken? Action still has not been taken, and I'm going to do something about it. If we actually tax those with higher incomes rather than giving them exceptions, we can get things under control.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5093, \"fields\": {\"question\": 919, \"description\": \"Our social programs need a lot of fixing. Now, it isn't the services themselves that are the problem but instead how accessible they are. They truly need to be for the people that need it. All government programs need to go through full means-testing. We can't play favorites.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5094, \"fields\": {\"question\": 919, \"description\": \"Healthcare is an issue I'm really concerned about. If we really want to improve our living standards. We truly need a progressive tax system. Currently, it's archaic. If we actually get such taxes in place, such as a national sales tax, we would see more revenues that can actually go towards that.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5095, \"fields\": {\"question\": 919, \"description\": \"So often do we forget the environment as an isssue. We must make sure to preserve it not only for future generations, but for safety as well. If we're going to get serious about environmental protections, we need a serious leader that will say no to these industries that get lead in the water.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5061, \"fields\": {\"question\": 918, \"description\": \"It's obvious isn't it? Put a microscope under all of Robertson's rhetoric. Just what, oh what, is he planning when he talks about restoring order from these concrete jungles? Welfare queens? Just about every issue imaginable. It's about selling fear, and we're going to be on top and dispel these lies.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5062, \"fields\": {\"question\": 918, \"description\": \"We need to put the focus on his truly draconian views on foreign policy. No doubt, must we have a strong military. Using it to combat the, new world order? The Soviets? This is all crazy! We need a sane leader that won't make any rash judgements.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5063, \"fields\": {\"question\": 918, \"description\": \"I want to make a compare and contrast of our character. While I was fighting for the civil rights of African Americans, Robertson has spoken at length his opposition to various measures to curb discrimination. It's pretty clear cut, Robertson pals around with deplorable figures.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5064, \"fields\": {\"question\": 914, \"description\": \"Robertson's values are the antithesis of what America was founded as a country. Our country has held the belief of seperation of church and state since its inception. Robertson wants to dismantle this very concept, and it's a chance we can't take.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5065, \"fields\": {\"question\": 914, \"description\": \"He's just a continuation of the current administration. One that's had the most officials implicated in crimes, supporting death squads in Latin America, when we will say enough is enough? We need a president with integrity, and I'll lead by example alright.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5066, \"fields\": {\"question\": 914, \"description\": \"Come on everybody! I know people are telling me to go for a more biting style, but we need to show America that hate has no place in America. When you compare our two personalities, well there's quite a disparity. Let's continue pushing on the issues, Robertson will tire himself out eventually.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5067, \"fields\": {\"question\": 915, \"description\": \"We need to restore trust after this whole Iran-Contra affair, and one way we're going to do so is make sure our defense personel are upright and tight. Integrity is perhaps the greatest weapon a nation can have, and is just as hard at keeping it intact.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5068, \"fields\": {\"question\": 915, \"description\": \"I want to discuss more about the 'Massachusetts Miracle' for a bit here. My state was ranked quite below on a few boards, but through shrewd governance we're seeing an economic boom irrelevant to Reagan's tenure. This is what I'll institute nationwide.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5069, \"fields\": {\"question\": 915, \"description\": \"I want to put more of a focus on crime, but more than that, the root causes. Now look, we need to address the systemic problems to the crime happening in America. You do that through community investment, firearm regulation, mental health services. That's how we stop tomorrows criminals.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5070, \"fields\": {\"question\": 915, \"description\": \"I would like to showcase my technocratic governance style to folks. Look, if I'm going win this election we're going to have to win over these tepid Republican voters. Robertson's practically the perfect candidate for this opportunity to work. Let's not waste it.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5071, \"fields\": {\"question\": 916, \"description\": \"It's a tough question, but we need to understand that the death penalty is outdated. If we focused on rehabilitation and putting the proper investments in place, you'd see crime down. This isn't rocket science, and if we treat it as Robertson believes you'd see more crime.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5072, \"fields\": {\"question\": 916, \"description\": \"I'm opposed to the death penalty, that isn't in doubt. What Massachusetts believes is best to conduct its policy in policing is just that, and so is California, Alabama, Indiana, you get it. The states should be able to administrate themselves while following federal jurisdiction.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5073, \"fields\": {\"question\": 916, \"description\": \"As you well know that my position on the death penalty is one I staunchly hold. When we use the state to adminster death we start to get all sorts of implications that I don't think need to be touched. That's why I'm opposed to the death penalty and would look for other ways for rehabilitation.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5074, \"fields\": {\"question\": 920, \"description\": \"The fact of the matter is that we need fiscal discipline as a nation and a part of that would be addressing just how inefficient our government is. Our deficit isn't getting any smaller. That's why I'm the only candidate that has an actual plan to address these problems, it all starts with means-testing.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5075, \"fields\": {\"question\": 920, \"description\": \"I'll tell you right now that there won't be any cuts to the Social Security fund. What is, under my plan, would be making the those that earn more pay their fair share. That's what this is about, enforcing fairness in our tax system.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5076, \"fields\": {\"question\": 920, \"description\": \"Under my plan, we would be able to fund education, healthcare, and our social programs without cutting a thing. A progressive tax system is a fair tax system. We're going to help those that truly need it.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5077, \"fields\": {\"question\": 924, \"description\": \"We're talking about the future! We've got to have optimism on what can be done now, so that tomorrow is possible. Our current industries are lacking, but if invest into technologies we would be at the cutting edge. I know we can do that, if we can land on the moon we can do this.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5078, \"fields\": {\"question\": 924, \"description\": \"A new vision for this country starts with looking in ourselves. We've seen trick-down economics fail, industries withering away, a lack of faith in our country. I see that we get this behind us, pull up our sleeves, and get the job done.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5079, \"fields\": {\"question\": 924, \"description\": \"I take a look at a fellow Democrat, John F. Kennedy, and remember his words. We do things not because they are easy, but because they are hard. I truly believe our country's resolve can truly find solutions to our problems, and I have the vision to get this through.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5096, \"fields\": {\"question\": 925, \"description\": \"Symms and I are like two peas in a pod, and I love that fact a lot. I want Symms to act like my attack dog. I mean he's already made a couple of statements that made it to the press, what's a few more that would do any harm?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5097, \"fields\": {\"question\": 925, \"description\": \"I've got to work on a few behind the scenes stuff, but he can act like my conduit around the country when I'm busy. He's got the right stuff to do this, so I don't think it would be harmful to take that chance.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5098, \"fields\": {\"question\": 925, \"description\": \"Symms you've got a gift. You're able to wind up these liberals and just get them to explode in anger, it's brilliant! While I'm speaking on the policy and numbers, you're riling up our base and getting those liberals angry.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5099, \"fields\": {\"question\": 926, \"description\": \"Quayle's my connection to the youth, and we'd be dumb to not use that. Get out there and get these young people pumped to support the ticket and Republicans as a whole. It would be a better way to connect with them than just by me forcing to do so.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5100, \"fields\": {\"question\": 926, \"description\": \"I still have problems with the rest of the party don't I? We're into the campaign, and they're holding their tongues in refusing to support me. Look, Quayle, you're perhaps the only person that can get them into the fold.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5101, \"fields\": {\"question\": 926, \"description\": \"What everyone's missing is the fact that Dan Quayle truly is a moral man. He's concerned about the wellbeing of the nuclear family, and I think we should continue this rhetoric some more. Why don't you speak up on it?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5102, \"fields\": {\"question\": 927, \"description\": \"Kemp knows a lot about economics doesn't he? I want him to go out and present our tax plan to the nation. He's got the authority to show we're serious, and they'll take him more seriously than I over could be.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5103, \"fields\": {\"question\": 927, \"description\": \"The problem this campaign's facing is that the press and just about everyone else don't take me seriously. All my policy, my rallies, they're just mocking me. I want Kemp to be side by side with me. Give me some legitimacy with a figure such as himself.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5104, \"fields\": {\"question\": 927, \"description\": \"I know Jack's been having some hard feeling since he's been on the ticket, he wants influence. I understand these things, and I'm willing to talk to him about it. He wants a sort of 'co-presidency'? We can certainly talk about it.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5105, \"fields\": {\"question\": 928, \"description\": \"Listen, Paul can be the straight man to my fiery oratory. While I'm speaking to the people, he's showing off the graphs and numbers and all that pointdexter stuff. Sounds like a plan, doesn't it Laxalt?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5106, \"fields\": {\"question\": 928, \"description\": \"I need the assurance of the party that they have my back. I've bend over backwards countless times to be in this position, and I want Republicans to put their trust in me. Laxalt, go and do your magic.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5107, \"fields\": {\"question\": 928, \"description\": \"I want to make it crystal clear that this campaign is practically a third term for Ronald Reagan. I know how we can cement this very fact, Laxlat should get Reagan to formally endorse me. This would make a massive difference.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5108, \"fields\": {\"question\": 929, \"description\": \"While Dornan was a replacement candidate, I'm really liking his energy! He's really speaking to our people every time we're holding rallies, he's definitely got a talent for this. How about we spring him out and let him do his own thing? Divide and conquer.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5109, \"fields\": {\"question\": 929, \"description\": \"I doubted Dornan at first, could you blame me? I wanted Deukmejian initially, but boy have I been wrong. Dornan's a natural isn't he? He's got that fiery spirit that's desperately needed. I want him to just go all out on these Democrats. Hold nothing back against them!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5110, \"fields\": {\"question\": 929, \"description\": \"I can't stand the press, just cannot stand them at all. They keep on pressing me and it's just getting me more and more beat. Dornan loves to suck in all the attention? Take on the press and show them what your really about.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5111, \"fields\": {\"question\": 930, \"description\": \"I'll defend him, and do so gladly. Why are the press zooming in on Symms' record? Shouldn't this be a good thing? People kept on discounting me because I don't have a record like these politicians, yet he's suddenly a problem for his votes. I fully discount these claims and have his back 1000%.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5112, \"fields\": {\"question\": 930, \"description\": \"The typical talking points from the insidious tabloids, they never get tired of covering me don't they? Symms is the quintessential Republican that stands up for the nation's health. These people have nothing of note to report, and go to these points. Talk about reaching.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5113, \"fields\": {\"question\": 930, \"description\": \"I know Symms has got this. He's proven himself to be a more than capable speaker and I have no doubt in my mind that he can take on these reporters just fine. Go get 'em Steve, show them what you're made of!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5114, \"fields\": {\"question\": 931, \"description\": \"Already we can see just how insidious the lying press are. Trying to make stuff up from thin air about the apparent lack of qualifications that Quayle has. He's been in the Senate since the start of the decade, and has shown his record to be strong. Just a bunch of lies.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5115, \"fields\": {\"question\": 931, \"description\": \"These talking heads really want to blow all this out of proportion don't they? Dan Quayle will be an upstanding Vice President and I'm glad to have him by my side. We'll pay these ludicrous exagerations no mind.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5116, \"fields\": {\"question\": 931, \"description\": \"Why's the lack of experience suddenly a drawback all of a sudden. I'm not in the Washington machine, but Quayle's got just as much experience as Jack Kennedy. All these attacks are just baseless, this is what we'll use whenever confronted about it.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5117, \"fields\": {\"question\": 932, \"description\": \"I'm going to go ahead and step Kemp aside to address these claims. Is it true? Well I can't possibly know, and only Kemp has the answer to that. He's denied it extrenously and I believe him. I'll make the rounds putting this ridiculous story to rest.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5118, \"fields\": {\"question\": 932, \"description\": \"This most definitely cannot be true, can it Jack? I mean we've met a few times before hand and you've never displayed the typical homo characterizations. This is all just tabloid gossip isn't it? Just keep on making the rounds whenever a reporter ambushes you about it.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5119, \"fields\": {\"question\": 932, \"description\": \"Is this true? I want a one-on-one with Kemp himself to see for myself. I don't believe these accusations, and believe he's saying the truth. Besides that, I want him to lessen in the appearances he makes so that all this blows over.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5120, \"fields\": {\"question\": 933, \"description\": \"Whatever Laxalt's private affairs occur are just that, private. The press, as always, sniffing and looking where they're not supposed to to get their 'next big story'. How shocking, ignore all these rags. I have my faith in Laxalt 100%.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5121, \"fields\": {\"question\": 933, \"description\": \"These types of lawsuits I've dealt with and I'll tell you one thing. They way these reporters cover this story is what I experienced. Boosting up illegitimate claims that do nothing more than muddy the waters. Laxalt was justified to seek that suit, and we're keeping tabs so watch out.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5122, \"fields\": {\"question\": 933, \"description\": \"Listen Paul, this is nothing too bad. I've dealt with these animals before and they're all talk and no bite. They're expecting a bad response from you, so prep some points and don't go further.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5123, \"fields\": {\"question\": 934, \"description\": \"I find these claims to be quite the reach. I've talked with Dornan, and have gotten to know him through the campaign. He's absolutely not the type of person that would be violent with their spouse. What these talking heads and tabloids are alleging is disgusting and should apologize immediately.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5124, \"fields\": {\"question\": 934, \"description\": \"Dornan has personally reached out to me and told me about their situation. While he did, in fact, did so. We are all not perfect. We make mistakes from time to time, and I believe that Dornan has improved for the better.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5125, \"fields\": {\"question\": 934, \"description\": \"Listen Dornan, these claims are getting too bad. It's getting really bad for us. Just go ahead and kill this entire thing. Bring your wife with you to campaign stops, show 'em that all these claims are false. You're a family man, and we're going to make America moral again!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5126, \"fields\": {\"question\": 940, \"description\": \"I knew the Gipper wouldn't let me down! I'm really, really thankful that he's willing to help me out. Would he be willing to campaign for us? I think he'd definitely be willing to do so, he's got that star-power that I don't.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5127, \"fields\": {\"question\": 940, \"description\": \"That's great news, I'm glad to see that Reagan truly knows that I'm an actual Republican despite all the fearmongering from fellow party members. I think we ought to use this opportunity to blast out the waves with Reagan's support. People'll certainly be drawed in.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5128, \"fields\": {\"question\": 940, \"description\": \"Thank you to the president for showing that I'm truly a Republican party man. It's a shame that so many fellow Republicans doubted my party credentials. I just want what's best for the country. I'd be more than delighted if he spoke in support of our movement, we've done more than enough for full acknowledgement.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5129, \"fields\": {\"question\": 941, \"description\": \"I knew Bush would've seen the light, he's truly a great guy. Let's hold our shoulders high and show how truly united our party is. We may have had our differences, but we're all Republicans at the end of the day. Let's go around rallying the base.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5130, \"fields\": {\"question\": 941, \"description\": \"When we look at how much we disagree with each other, it's truly not much. We're for a strong defense, a booming economy, all that sort of conservative policy. I'll let him do his magic, I'm certain he can reach out to these voters more suspicious of my campaign.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5131, \"fields\": {\"question\": 941, \"description\": \"We didn't get Reagan to fully support my campaign besides the usual rally around the candidate rhetoric. Bush, however, I'm at least thankful for his support. Who knows, I'm thinking a cabinet position would be nice for a man of his talents.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5132, \"fields\": {\"question\": 942, \"description\": \"Malcom Wallop - I've been seeing all these eyes on Wyoming. Why's that? I thought it would've been safely in our hands? What better to show these people that I'm a real team player than getting a brief campaign stop over there and support the incumbent Republican. Nobody's going to be doubting me after, surely.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5133, \"fields\": {\"question\": 942, \"description\": \"Pete Wilson - I love California so much, well more the better sides of the state away from 'those people'. I want to increase our name presence in the area. I'm telling you there's untapped potential that the pollsters are getting wrong.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5134, \"fields\": {\"question\": 942, \"description\": \"Newt Gingrich - I heard a lot of good things about Newt, we might've even talked to each other. Quite frankly, I can't remember all the people I've met in my long career in broadcasting. Anyways, I'm sure Gingrich can help refine some points, show I'm really serious about governing.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5135, \"fields\": {\"question\": 942, \"description\": \"John Danforth - I've heard lots of good things about Danforth. He's a Christian, he's a Republican, and he's just an all around swell guy. Now that's a person I want to get close to. It also wouldn't hurt if he put a good word in for me with other Republicans. Hypothetically, of course.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5136, \"fields\": {\"question\": 944, \"description\": \"I thought these Republicans would've been aware of the Eleventh Commandment...\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5137, \"fields\": {\"question\": 945, \"description\": \"I thought these Republicans would've been aware of the Eleventh Commandment...\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5138, \"fields\": {\"question\": 946, \"description\": \"I thought these Republicans would've been aware of the Eleventh Commandment...\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5139, \"fields\": {\"question\": 947, \"description\": \"We're not perfect, and I certainly know they think so as well. I know they'll come to see this as a signal from God.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5140, \"fields\": {\"question\": 948, \"description\": \"We're not perfect, and I certainly know he thinks that as well. I know he'll come to see this as a signal from God.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5141, \"fields\": {\"question\": 949, \"description\": \"That guy, was a homo. Yeah, yeah, sure as your alive. He has that cadence, that pattern. Just like the rest of 'em. They're brainwashed, but you can't help them. They're going to meet their righteous fury.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5142, \"fields\": {\"question\": 951, \"description\": \"I say we say enough is enough. These thugs have destroyed our people, our communities. Like an urban jungle, they're merciless in seeking their greed. We're going to do something about it, and the liberals ain't going to do anything about it.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5143, \"fields\": {\"question\": 951, \"description\": \"We're going to lock up these deviants. These anti-social folks. These just straight despicable people. We've seen what happens in Massachusetts when these criminals are given a pass. They rape, they pillage, and they don't forgive. I say we give it right back to 'em, and show no forgiveness to them!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5144, \"fields\": {\"question\": 951, \"description\": \"There is absolutely a stark difference between Dukakis and I. I'm talking in support of the rule of law, not the jungle, meanwhile Dukakis is out here giving furlough passes to rapists and murderers. Look at that Willie Horton, now I will say that's not an upstandng citizen. It's only right for people to be blasted with him.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5145, \"fields\": {\"question\": 952, \"description\": \"Babbitt's making lots of enemies, and surely not enough friends. I mean, come on! Liberals are vocally criticizing his platform for what it contains. We'll just keep going and keep the course. He definitely doesn't have the skills to get these liberals on his side.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5146, \"fields\": {\"question\": 952, \"description\": \"Would you just look at that? The Democrats can't keep things together can they? You got the radicals insistently attacking him for his spending cuts. Now wouldn't you know? I'm also for cutting needless spending in the government. I'm glad we agree on one thing!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5147, \"fields\": {\"question\": 952, \"description\": \"You see what he's proposing, now I know we're speaking the same language somewhat but wouldn't it be great to sweep under the rug for his voters? I'm talking the hardhat men, the working class. I'm sure these people don't like what he's selling. I'm going to represent your interests.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5148, \"fields\": {\"question\": 953, \"description\": \"It seems that Hart got caught with his hand in the cookie jar hasn't he? This is absolutely a perfect example of how our current nation is panning out. Our basic moral values are thrown out of the window in favor for this hedonism. It's disgusting and Hart's the perfect reflection of our culture today.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5149, \"fields\": {\"question\": 953, \"description\": \"Hart just can't help himself can he? This is the perfect moment to play up my marriage with my dear wife. Unlike Hart, I've always stayed loyal to Dede and will do so till the end of time. Let's get her to accompany us on the campaign trail. Really hit this point home.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5150, \"fields\": {\"question\": 953, \"description\": \"Hart has broke his vows he made with his wife. Though That woman should have never have done this. We let feminism allow society to get to this point. We all know what happened to Sodam and Gomorrah.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5015, \"fields\": {\"question\": 912, \"description\": \"I've seen what can get done with nothing but your hands and determination. Everyday working for your family and building them a future, I can hear them. We're going to the places most forgotten by the bigwigs. The once great steel towns and steel cities like Michigan. Let's wear some hardhats!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5016, \"fields\": {\"question\": 912, \"description\": \"How about we end this where it's sunny? While California has a lot of problems, the weather is not one of them. Well, at least partially. If we can get those outside of the decadent cities out to vote for values, then it's a good job well done. Let's show off our campaign as the new wave!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5017, \"fields\": {\"question\": 912, \"description\": \"Let's go to the heart of the movement. Where true American values were practiced and cherished, and are still applied to this day. The Evangelical movement is strong especially in Texas. Dallas is nice, and we'll get a proper welcome from our people.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer\", \"pk\": 5018, \"fields\": {\"question\": 912, \"description\": \"Who said anything about focusing on one specific state or region? We're going to get as many of our offices around the country to hold these tele-rallies. All broadcasting my message for everyone to hear. This is the real gift of satellite, being able to spread a message with ease.\"}}]");

