campaignTrail_temp.answer_feedback_json = JSON.parse("[{\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1973, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4366, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"We barely squeaked by in South Carolina, but I'm hearing we're coasting by on Super Tuesday states. Not a bad day isn't it?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1855, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4367, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I see what you're thinking, but the results from Super Tuesday were a bit lacking. Kemp and du Pont aren't doing us any favors. Let's consider turning down the temperature alright?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1856, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4368, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"We're straining our capacity. Super Tuesday was an alright night, but the results were suboptimal based on expectations. No no I didn't mean li– forget I said anything.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1857, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4369, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I know you're getting tired of all the professionalism, but it's worth it alright? Talk figures, tangible concepts, the works. We'll peel those Reagan Democrats no doubt.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1858, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4370, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Of course, of course. We still need to show we're to be taken seriously, playing with our thumbs is not beating claims of vanity. No. No no no, that's not what I meant!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1859, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4371, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I get where you're coming from, but we need to be grounded. Bush's clinching Pennsylvania, Dole Minnesota. We're losing ground, perhaps it's up to the delegate math.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1860, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4372, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is exactly what I'm suggesting! We're going to show off the program. The tax rates, the exact prescriptions to address crime. Perhaps put in something with the defict? I'll get it all situated, don't worry.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1861, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4402, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"You're heated, I get it. All this mudslinging certainly can't be good going into the convention in Louisiana. I'll just... clear the record for the press.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1862, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4403, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I'm getting word from California that you snagged it. This is huge! Sure, the math doesn't show much of a change from before but it'll give us momentum.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1866, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5000, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The states went about how I thought they would've gone. Our momentum is a bit deflated though, Dole seems to be coming out the proportional victor from these contests.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1867, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4373, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Good news. The Kemp and du Pont leaders are hearing us out, and won't budge until another ballot. Bad news. I'm hearing musings of a potential Howard Baker compromise candidacy.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1868, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4374, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Their leaders aren't approaching us. We're not losing support, yet not gaining ground otherwise.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1870, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4375, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Some Bush delegates have switched their support from the Vice President. We're at a striking distance, but I don't know if the math is there for us.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1871, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4523, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The committee relented, they'll even let in those that were shown the door. I had to promise them you'll concede on a few points of the platform. You don't like it, but it'll be the only way they accept you.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1872, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4524, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The committee, the whole convention frankly, just wants this to end. The balloting is tiring everyone out. I'll see if I can get some lukewarm Bush people to end this. They won't be happy, but it'll be one last ballot.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1873, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4382, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This'll certainly make skeptical Republicans perk up on our campaign. Though I suspect our supporters wanted something more fiery. Can't win everyone I suppose.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1874, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4383, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Our delegation loved it, clapping it up and hollering. Everyone else? Just plain confused. I think it's best if you were less in the abstract, and more into specifics.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1879, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4384, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is definitely the defining moment of the entire convention. Everyone was in awe at your oratory, I'm sure no one's going to be doubting you after that. Though, about the recent article...\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1880, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5001, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"What a good turn. I think I saw some of Bush's guys hide a smirk. If we keep this up, the White House is an afterthought!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1886, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4388, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Exactly right. We need to broaden the party tent, and you're just the candidate to do so.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1887, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4389, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I've hit a couple of snags, they're asking for a lot of concessions. Appointments, legislation, everything you've stated you won't budge on. I'll try and see if we can come to an understanding.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1889, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4390, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Astute observation. Although I'll caution going so biting this early into the campaign season. We need to build up your profile, and these columns on the press aren't painting a fond picture.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1948, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5002, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I'll see about putting up our infomercials back up in key markets. They were always the ones that polled the most favorably anyhow.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1949, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4405, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I'm sorry. I didn't clear everything beforehand, now we got a notice from New Order regarding using Blue Monday. I'll be more stringent on what our volunteers play next time. In better news, I've gotten hold of a couple of Bush's guys.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1950, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4406, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Makes sense. Although I caution on banking on one particular group. We're aiming for a national coalition aren't we? In other news, I've gotten hold of a couple of Bush's guys.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1951, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5010, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"They're not returning my calls. In other news, I've gotten hold of a couple of Bush's guys.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1958, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5011, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I understand, it's what your best at. From what the numbers say, a good chunk of people tuned in. In other news, I've gotten hold of a couple of Bush's guys.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1959, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4386, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Great call there! You did, after all, sign that pledge so it only makes sense to emphasize it. Democrats will speak of it's constraints, but don't listen to them.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1960, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4387, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I appreciate your digging in the sand, but there are certain issues that are worth not dying on hills. This is one of them. I'll have to do damage control, clarify you don't mean Social Security.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1965, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4501, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is certainly resonating answer for the public. Though, I'd caution on some of your phrases. 'Urban jungle' and 'loot and pillage' just bring about unnecessary connotations is all.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1966, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4502, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"A bit of a conciliatory tone? I don't see why that's a major problem. Though the base might be a bit deflated however. They're certainly concerned about the crime rate.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1967, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4503, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"We're seeing a lot of coverage about the 'Revolving Door' piece. It's certainly popular, definitely with suburban communities. Though networks are asking me to clarify if the visuals of certain inmates were intentionally darkened.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1968, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4481, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Easier said than done, but we've combined the lists. I'll see if we can get a few of these stragglers to pitch in. I'd imagine soothing tensions with the party would've been smarter long term however.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1974, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4482, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The sentiment is understandable, but there's contribution limits to this. I've seen an uptick from our donors for the max of $1,000. I know your repulsed by public financing, but... okay, nevermind.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1975, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4483, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I may have just made a breakthrough! A couple of heads from these organizations, they're willing to dole out some expenditures for the campaign. I got some headway with insiders as well! Though they're harder to budge, but they've picked up my calls at least.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1976, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4489, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is rhetoric that'll get everyone moving! Great job. Just, next time when specified please don't mention South Africa. The press are up at my neck about this. Just... I don't know. I'll try my best bringing it to Eastern Europe or South America instead.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1977, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4490, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Listen, I believe having all these bureaucrats creates a lot of the inefficiency we're seeing in government. Don't you think this is just too explicit? Understood, those whiz kids won't know what hit them!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1982, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4491, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I had to clarify that you meant your humanitarian work in the region, and not arming the Contras. Not good, not good.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1983, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4511, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"All these tabloids are talking about how we're struggling to maintain Republican strongholds. I'm sorry, but we're fighting back aren't we? Lets keep this energy up!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1984, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4512, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Wearing these hardhats seem tacky don't they? I'm just not used to these crowds and attention is all. Though 'Silent Brigade' does have a ring to it doesn't it? At least that's one thing these reporters got right.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1985, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4513, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I swear we cleared everything. The volunteers were cleared beforehand and they played... DEVO? Jerkin' Back 'N' Forth? The youth these days... they need saving. You're the only cure, we got this.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1986, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4515, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Exactly. Expect these reporters to continue airing out your dirty laundry regardless, but take the high road and talk the issues facing Americans. We got this.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1987, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4516, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I understand this is personal to you, but you need to let some things go. They'll see opportunity and strike at your lowest. Okay, got it. I won't mention it again.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1988, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4517, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"We can't afford this in the midst of an electoral campaign. Just, settle down. Okay, okay. I'll get letters sent to tabloids.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1989, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4396, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Definitely going to play well with working class families. Just got to thank Carter don't we? Now, I want to talk to you about that rally we're planning.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 1998, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4395, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is the right idea. Reagan's economy is our benefit, and showing voters that'll certainly turn things around. We got the card up our sleeve.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 4397, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5012, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The conference was commendable. The aftermath, I'll have to work overtime to clarify what you mean. Next time, keep abstract concepts like the jubilee off the conversation.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2000, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4385, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Great analogy there, but... certain people aren't taking it too kindly. I think it's best if you speak in vague language next time. People want hope, and you'll provide them that.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4514, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Seeing your face on the big screen is definitely a unique experience. Everyone attending loves it, and the reporters love this novel idea. We're getting attention, and we're not even spending unnecessary dollars!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4506, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This doesn't bode well for the campaign. While it's just a personal suit, the reporters and the like won't treat it as such. We'll be tied to it. Just... I'll try and deflect if addressed.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4507, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Seems like the rumors and gossip of your military service has died down, was almost worried there. Though here's a tabloid that got an exclusive interview with McCloskey. S–sorry. Sorry, I won't show you anything like that again.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5013, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"These clips, from what I've seen, are playing well with a broad audience. Hopefully this helps take back any skepticism about your service. Anyways, I got us a meeting with some Korean diplomats. Please show respect, this is a good opportunity to burnish your credentials.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4495, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is something that our base is glad to see you continue to stand up for, but you need to tone down your rhetoric. Alright? We need to make inroads with independents, and this'll make you seem more crackpot.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4496, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is an alright pivot, it'll certainly alleviate Republicans that your restraining yourself. Although our base will certainly be deflated by our lack of defense for our position.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4497, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is a good sympathetic response, we're going to definitely make inroads with people. Those Reagan Democrats can definitely be reached, and continuing this approach can work wonders.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4379, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Showcasing what you stand for is always a good thing, and doing so this far out certainly isn't a negative. I've been seeing the reception, and it seems opinions are shifting on you. Now instead of alienated, they're simply skeptical. Great!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4380, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is what you've been saying since the beginning, and continuing to push this is what'll make you a serious candidate. Foreign policy is right in your wheelhouse, and Republicans at large are certainly happy you're focusing on that.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 4381, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"From what polls have been saying, taxes are one of the top issues this campaign. It's only common sense to talk about it, and how Republicans are the trusted party on this issue. We'll win this.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5014, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Reagan's coattails isn't over, and we're going to carry the torch once we're elected! These spots are seen much more positively than others from test audiences. We're accelerating for sure.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5019, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This hits all the marks that our base likes, and it plays well with a wide net of voters. Though, please clarify what you mean whenever you claim to clean the streets. I can't keep up with these reporters.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5020, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is good for the base, but it's too rhetorically risky with independents. The talking heads are replaying your various ill-advised comments during your broadcasts. We still got this.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5021, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"We're getting the support of various local parental advisory boards, we're doing the right thing aren't we? We're going to protect the kids from these satanic influences.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5022, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Standing side by side with Falwell is really sending a message. You two are really speaking to the families, and your oratory moves everyone. They're listening to the message and we're going to take the White House.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5023, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This isn't looking good for optics. Mecham is not popular with the state Republicans, and is already facing an effort to recall him. Tying yourself to him, not a good look. Though conservatives are happy to see us standing with another.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5024, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The Chief of Staff told me to buzz off. Now we have Blondie playing to an audience that aren't going to get the man they wanted to see so eagerly. I swear we were going to get these volunteers properly vetted.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5025, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The two of you go together like peanut butter and jelly. Standing up for morality, American values, and what's right for the country. Prayer, taxes, and defense. No, no no no. I didn't mean it like that. Okay, I apologize. I won't do that again.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5155, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"That's right, stand up to these duplicitous talking heads! Now, our people are not going to be swayed by this. Everyone else however... we're going to have to work overtime.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5156, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Look, that was a perfectly acceptable answer. Actually, it was more than adequate and shows you won't buckle down to societal pressure. Our people are more than happy, but I'm going to have to tell you to tone the mentions of abortion a bit when campaigning. Alright?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5157, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Straight to the point, no moralizing, acted with restraint. You did a good job. Unfortunately, these talking heads are talking about it incessantly. Why aren't they talking about your points about foreign policy? Taxes? Credibility? Push them on that!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5026, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The reporters, the news anchors. They're talking about how unfeasible this is. What do they know? I see an uptick of our favorability after this. We got a chance. These talking heads don't know what they're talking about.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5027, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Right. Holding onto Reagan's legacy is a winning issue, I see the opinion polls. All these Democrats seem to talk about Iran-Contra. He's innocent, and everyone agrees. We're the majority aren't we? Yeah.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5028, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The Democrats are all spend, spend, spend. Pay-as-you-go liberalism is showing its cracks. These spots are being received positively. Glad we put the Republican brand as the focus. No offense.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5029, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is perfectly acceptable. Some of the rank-and-file Republicans won't like that we're not going to do more on this, but we got to win over these uneasy voters. Nobody likes government waste, but Social Security is the third-rail.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5030, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The party is certainly going to like you standing on party values, but we have a problem. The Democrats' are making hay with our blatant admission. Let's just hope that people respect honesty over politics.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5151, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is a good swerve into good territory. While Social Security is a poison pill for us, if we treat it as a problem of individual responsibility then we can be on even ground with the Democrats.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5152, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This is hitting all the notes that we know full and well is going on in the government. You're telling it right, and we're going to clean up the mess. Though... I don't think the white ethnics like your dig at them. Nothing we can't fix.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5153, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The court's legitimacy is a point in our favor. We're talking the court that gave criminals rights, and this full well and shows that it's compromised. You're talking sense.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5154, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Attacking the government-funded institutions is always a good attack. We're talking about schools that treat evolution as established fact, nonsense. Let's push for private schools at the next rally alright?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5015, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Thanks for passing me a hardhat!\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5016, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"<i>We're the kids. We're the kids. We're the kids living in America.</i>\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5017, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Dallas gave us a warm welcome.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5018, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"You're speaking to the core of America, and we're going to prove these talking heads wrong.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5003, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Symms is all fine and good, but don't you think we should at least give Bush's people something?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5080, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Symms is all fine and good, but don't you think we should at least give Bush's people something?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5081, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Symms is all fine and good, but don't you think we should at least give Bush's people something?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5004, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"He's definitely much more amiable to the Bush and Dole people, and maybe Quayle'll even show conservatism as the young people's ideology.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5082, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"He's definitely much more amiable to the Bush and Dole people, and maybe Quayle'll even show conservatism as the young people's ideology.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5083, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"He's definitely much more amiable to the Bush and Dole people, and maybe Quayle'll even show conservatism as the young people's ideology.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5005, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Kemp's a conservative, but enough of a party man to make them breathe a sigh of relief. Though he's expecting influence in the administration.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5084, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Kemp's a conservative, but enough of a party man to make them breathe a sigh of relief. Though he's expecting influence in the administration.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5085, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Kemp's a conservative, but enough of a party man to make them breathe a sigh of relief. Though he's expecting influence in the administration.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5006, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Laxalt's definitely a branch to these higher-up Republicans, and it seems the convention is cheering us on.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5086, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Laxalt's definitely a branch to these higher-up Republicans, and it seems the convention is cheering us on.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5087, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Laxalt's definitely a branch to these higher-up Republicans, and it seems the convention is cheering us on.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5007, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I think I found the right man for you! I had to scour all over the place, it's not too often you have to beg people to join a ticket huh? Now, listen to this. He's a congressman out of Orange County. He's got fire in his eyes, he's a dead-to-rights conservative, and he'll stick by you 100%. Now, let's get this whole convention over and done with.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5096, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I've had to pull Symms back and rein him in on a few topics. He's getting a bit too carried away here. Can you step in?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5097, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Symms is a natural with our base, but everyone else is turned off by him. He's just too bombastic. I'll give him some pointers next time.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5098, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Can you please get Symms to turn down the temperature? I had to play damage control over his comments about Asian Americans. The talking heads love him for the wrong reasons.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5099, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Quayle's picquing the interest of people, but for the wrong reasons. He's perfectly capable, but they're treating him like he's a child. These duplicitous people.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5100, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"The establishment won't talk to us, but Quayle's got some sway. I just got a meeting with some organization guys. Got to thank him for that.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5101, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Quayle is really in his element right around here. Though I had to retract a comment about what he said about music and the pop genre. Can't win everything though right?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5102, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"He's definitely the right man we could've asked for in a campaign. Though our people are not interested. Whenever your speaking, they're captivated. With him, they aren't. Strange.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5103, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"While we're seeing some pushback on the false claims against you, it seems like they're moving onto Kemp instead. Asking him why he decided to join our campaign. I'll try and guide him on some responses.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5104, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"When I said we're willing to put it on the table, he noticeably perked up. I've been seeing a lot of energy from him lately. So, just how much control as we willing to lend him?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5105, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Look. Laxalt is fine being the straight man, it adds an aura of competency that's been lacking. I feel this just isn't the way to go. What do I know?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5106, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I don't really know what's going on with Laxalt. I think he's keeping up in the dark. Though I've been seeing an influx of attack ads against our opponent. Maybe he's getting, at least, something done.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5107, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Laxalt told me to not inquire him further on this topic.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5108, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Look, Dornan's all well and good but he seems to relish a bit too much in the campaign. He's even inviting the press to follow him wherever he goes. I'm going to try and reign him in a bit. You try to as well.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5109, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I had to apologize for a recent comment that Dornan made to the press. He called them 'a bunch of homos'. Can you please tell him to cut it out and act at least a little dignified?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5110, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"It's all well and good, we're definitely getting less heat for you. However, it seems that Dornan is still hurting our campaign by being the firebrand he seems to be playing up as I know you like it, but we have a campaign to win.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5111, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Standing by him and keeping it at that may be for the best. I'll coordinate with Symms and try to reign him in.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5112, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"You are exactly correct, but the talking heads certainly aren't going to stop reporting on it. Unfortunately, Symms is prime for political prodding.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5113, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I had to damage control over Symms' recent comments. There's a time and a place to be an attack dog, but saying they're in a cabal is not doing us any favors.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5114, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Quayle's relieved to see you sticking up for him, though that won't stop the talking heads I'm afraid. I'll try and coach him whenever confronted by these reporters.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5115, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"It's well and good to not give the press any further gossip, but they're still going to try and define Quayle's apparent , We're letting them define the narrative.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5116, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"It's a clear and distinct call back, and people'll certainly like it. The press are making absurd rebuttals to this claim, and the public aren't complaining about Quayle's youthfulness. Ain't I right?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5117, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"While these tabloids are going to keep on running Kemp's name in the mud, we're going to defend his character. I've seen him recently and he seems more willing to campaign.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5118, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"What did you say to Kemp? He's not indicated any inclination at leaving the campaign, but he seems more frustrated lately.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5119, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I think we're going to have to address this eventually, or at the very least denounce these libelous attacks. Kemp seems more tired than usual.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5120, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Laxalt's relieved to see you have his back, and you two have definitely gone through the courts and can relate. Though we need to keep our guard with these reporters.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5121, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Did you ininuate that you'll seek retributive lawsuits if these reporters continue? I think Laxalt and I will tell you to relax and settle down a little, alright?\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5122, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Laxalt seemed to have made his case to everyone at the announcement. I think it should make these claims die down, but I'm not sure if it'll go down in the public's view.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5123, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Let's just pull back on Dornan's appearances this late into the campaign, alright? It'll save us time dealing with these smug reporters.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5124, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Our people are going to believe your talk with Dornan. Everyone else? Well, they'll certainly believe whatever the press prints. Let's just limit him on the trail.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5125, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I'll have to stop you right there. This spat with the press is not helping in your favorability and I think it's best if we just simply limit Dornan's campaign appearances. Need to play damage control.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5126, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"He's not going out too far, but California will definitely enjoy the appearance of our president. Can I be next to you though? Always wanted to see him in person.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5127, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"This recent spot with Reagan interspersed with Republican accomplishments is seeming to be thought of positively by the test screenings. It's going to play fantastic once it airs.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5128, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"He speaks for the majority of Americans, and he's passing the torch right to us isn't he? We're the start of a new movement, and Reagan and the party at large has recognized this. Finally.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5129, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Something seems off about Bush. He's rubbing shoulders and really promoting unity, but he seems a bit miffed. His speeches seem to be about the party and not about you. He won't accept rallies next to you.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5130, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"He's really promoting the party, we'll appreciate it. Where is any mention of your candidacy though? It just seems like a test run for a campaign in 1992. Let's just hope we clinch this.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5131, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I've tried getting to Bush's staff about getting him a position. They're not answering me. So what you're thinking? Defense? State? We still have some time to finalize the list.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5132, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"It seems like you were really in your element, nice cowboy hat there.. Wallop's been down in the polls, but this might get our people to shore him over the line. We can only hope.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5133, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Wilson's been more than amicable. I can count from my hand how many high-profile Republicans associated with us, at least he's a part of that club.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5134, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"Gingirch is one of the few good Republicans. He stands for real conservative principles, and that whole budget fiasco just shows it. He told me to give you this. It's a list of goals we can push through, I think it's admirable.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5135, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"He's a party man, but he's willing to play ball with us. Though he told me to rescind some of the more extreme positions in the platform. Why don't you listen to me? It'll be good for being viewed positively with the demographics we need to win.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5136, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I'm going to have to do damage control. I'll just say that we're still polling well with certain demographics, deflect from there. Just... please don't lash out against the press.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5137, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I'm going to have to do damage control. I'll just say that we're still polling well with certain demographics, deflect from there. Just... please don't lash out against the press.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5138, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I'm going to have to do damage control. I'll just say that we're still polling well with certain demographics, deflect from there. Just... please don't lash out against the press.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5139, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_feedback\": \"I know you cut close ties with them a while while back, but that won't stop these talking heads. I'll just deflect any questions if they're ever mentioned.\"}}, {\"model\": \"campaign_trail.answer_feedback\", \"pk\": 2001, \"fields\": {\"answer\": 5140, \"candidate\": 152, \"answer_